{"title":"꿈자리가 이상한데요?!","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"\"누군가 다른 사람이 …만져줬으면 좋겠어.\"\n\n의뢰인을 괴롭히는 꿈속 악귀를 물리치던 신이범은\n도리어 역을 맞게 된다.\n\n문제는 그 역이 '불타는 성욕'으로 발현된다는 것…!\n\n\"…도와줄게요. 신이범 씨가 원하는 대로 해요.\"\n\n아르바이트생 한정오는 이범을 따라 꿈속에 들어갔다가\n불타는 성욕을 진압(?)하는 임무를 수행한다.\n\n\n'맞닿은 몸의 부피감, 끌어안은 압력,\n…그다음은?\n\n더 깊이… 더 깊이 닿고 싶어.\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------\n*매주 월요일(일요일 22시) 4주 연재 후 1주 휴재*","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":160,"change":{"type":"up","amount":112}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":263,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":222,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":283,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":123479,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":123505,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":123523,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":123537,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":123543,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":123552,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":123559,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":123563,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":123592,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":123636,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":123650,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":123676,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":123679,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":176},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":123708,"rc":883,"rs":8821,"cc":